    "title": "The Health Bill Explained: What Abolishing NHS England Means for the People Who Work in It",
    "seoTitle": "Health Bill 2026: What NHS England Abolition Means for Jobs",
    "metaDescription": "The Health Bill would abolish NHS England, change ICB duties and merge HSSIB into the CQC. A plain-English guide for NHS and care staff on what changes.",
    "slug": "health-bill-nhs-england-abolition-2026",
