    "title": "Green Shoots and Skills Gaps: The State of UK Pharmaceutical Jobs in 2026",
    "seoTitle": "UK Pharmaceutical Industry Jobs 2026: Growth and Skills Gaps",
    "metaDescription": "UK pharma could add 81,300 jobs by 2035, but science graduate numbers are falling and visas cost £12,000+. What 2026 data means for life sciences careers.",
    "slug": "uk-pharmaceutical-industry-jobs-skills-2026",
    "category": "Pharmacy & Pharma",
