    "seoTitle": "NHS 10 Year Workforce Plan: Delays and What to Expect (2026)",
    "metaDescription": "The NHS 10 Year Workforce Plan has slipped from 2025 to autumn 2026. What we know, why unions raised concerns, and what staff and employers can do now.",
