    "seoTitle": "Newly Qualified Nurses Can't Find Jobs: The 2026 Paradox",
    "metaDescription": "Only 26% of band 5 nursing adverts audited by the RCN were open to new graduates. Why a short-staffed NHS is turning away qualified nurses and physios.",
